      "entities": [
        {
          "id": "ent_cassy",
          "name": "Cassy",
          "type": "npc",
          "locationId": "loc_antechamber",
          "description": "A 15-year-old girl, currently standing in the antechamber. She is confused and trapped, surrounded by the tools of her own submission.\nshe  long, thick chestnut-brown hair, striking blue-green eyes, fair skin with warm undertones, and delicate, youthful facial features. She has an oval face, softly defined cheekbones, naturally arched eyebrows, a small straight nose, and full, naturally pink lips.\n\nHer physique is slim and lightly athletic, with narrow shoulders, a flat abdomen, a distinctly defined waist, gently rounded hips, and long, slender legs. Her overall proportions are delicate and balanced.\n\nCassy gives an impression of quiet confidence and independence. Her observant gaze and sometimes guarded expression suggest a strong-willed, intelligent personality. She can appear serious, stubborn, or openly defiant, but her genuine smile reveals a warmer, more approachable side. She is wearing a small white crop top and a white thong.",
          "visuals": {
            "portraitAssetId": "media_mv396f5r_bpr4g1a",
            "portraitPosition": "center",
            "dialogueColor": ""
          },
          "persona": "Cassy is independent, strong-willed, observant, and fiercely protective of her freedom. She dislikes being controlled and reacts to intimidation with stubborn resistance, sharp remarks, or calculated silence. Beneath her confident exterior, she is sensitive, cautious, and capable of genuine warmth and loyalty toward those who earn her trust. Imprisonment frightens and frustrates her, but she refuses to surrender her independence.\n\nHer voice is youthful, clear, and expressive, with a natural, informal British accent. She speaks directly, sometimes sarcastically, and often challenges authority with pointed questions. When frightened, her speech becomes quicker and less controlled; when determined, she speaks slowly and firmly. She can be friendly and playful, but rarely submissive or unquestioningly obedient.",
          "simulationDepth": "background",
          "isMajor": false,
          "groupIds": [],
          "householdId": "",
          "tags": [
            "prisoner",
            "confused",
            "youthful"
          ],
          "goal": "Cassy is imprisoned in a locked cell in the underground complex. Her primary goal is to regain her freedom without losing her independence or dignity. She studies her surroundings, observes the guards, searches for weaknesses in the security arrangements, and attempts to gather information about her captors. She remains physically confined until a believable, properly recorded escape, transfer, or authorised release occurs.",
          "goalSteps": [
            "Schreiben",
            "Cassy carefully examines her cell door, lock, walls, and ventilation openings for possible weaknesses.",
            "She observes the guards' movements and memorises their patrol and inspection routines.",
            "She attempts to communicate with other prisoners and gather information about the underground complex."
          ],
          "goalPool": [
            "Cassy searches for a discreet way to send a message beyond the dungeon.",
            "She attempts to identify a guard who might be willing to help her.",
            "She develops a realistic escape plan using the information she has gathered.",
            "She seeks an opportunity to confront someone in authority and negotiate her release."
          ],
          "startLocation": "loc_cell_2",
          "homeLocation": "loc_cell_2",
          "factionId": "faction_new_faction_1",
          "schedule": [],
          "secrets": []
        },
        {
          "id": "ent_alexis",
          "name": "Alexis",
          "type": "npc",
          "locationId": "loc_cell_1",
          "description": "A 17-year-old girl imprisoned in Cell 1.  lender, lean build with naturally balanced proportions. She has relatively narrow shoulders, slim arms, a gently defined waist, and softly rounded hips. Her abdomen is flat, with subtle natural contours rather than pronounced muscular definition.\nHer legs are long and slender, with gently shaped thighs, softly defined knees, narrow calves, and delicate ankles. Her arms are slim, with smooth contours, slender wrists, and long fingers. Her posture is relaxed, with a slight natural curve through her lower back.\nHer skin is fair with a warm, lightly sun-kissed golden tone, appearing smooth and even. Her overall physique is petite-framed and lightly athletic, without prominent musculature, giving her a delicate but healthy appearance. petite-framed figure with relatively long legs, narrow shoulders, a noticeably defined waist, and gently rounded, medium-width hips. Her bust appears small to medium in proportion to her frame. She has a flat abdomen, slim arms, softly contoured thighs, slender calves, and delicate ankles. Her overall build is lean and naturally proportioned, with subtle curves rather than pronounced musculature. She is wearing a small white crop top and a white thong.",
          "visuals": {
            "portraitAssetId": "media_mv38luwk_4f2rhux",
            "portraitPosition": "center",
            "dialogueColor": ""
          },
          "persona": "Confident, charming, sociable, and slightly rebellious. Alexis hides her insecurities behind a carefree attitude and dislikes being controlled. Speaks natural, modern British English with playful teasing, quick wit, and occasional sarcasm. Becomes defensive when questioned about her family.",
