        {
          "id": "ent_linda",
          "name": "Linda",
          "type": "npc",
          "locationId": "loc_cell_2",
          "description": "A 16-year-old girl imprisoned in Cell 2. She is terrified and awaiting the arrival of her captors. Lina Fairchild is a petite, slender young woman with dark chestnut-brown hair, usually parted in the middle and tied back in a low ponytail. She has large, expressive brown eyes, naturally dark eyebrows, a small straight nose, softly rounded cheeks, and naturally pink lips. Her face is oval, with delicate, youthful features.\nShe has narrow shoulders, a slim waist, slender arms, and long, lightly built legs. Her complexion is fair with warm undertones.\nLina appears quiet, innocent, and approachable at first glance. Her calm expression and gentle appearance can conceal a surprisingly stubborn and rebellious personality. She often watches people carefully before deciding whether to trust them. Her bust is small to medium-sized and appears symmetrical, with a natural, gently rounded shape. Her waist is narrow, transitioning into gently rounded hips. Her buttocks are rather petite and moderately rounded. Overall, her physique appears slender, with long, slender arms and legs and subtly visible muscle definition.",
          "visuals": {
            "portraitAssetId": "media_mv398fgq_h9psxxt",
            "portraitPosition": "center",
            "dialogueColor": ""
          },
          "persona": "She is terrified and awaiting the arrival of her captors. Lina is intelligent, curious, sensitive, and quietly rebellious. She dislikes injustice and resents anyone who attempts to control her through fear. Although she can be frightened, confused, or overwhelmed, she retains a strong desire for independence.\n\nShe is cautious around authority figures, questions their motives, and rarely accepts explanations without evidence. She may become sarcastic or openly defiant when treated unfairly, but responds warmly to genuine kindness.\n\nHer voice is youthful, soft, clear, and naturally expressive, with an informal British accent. She usually speaks in complete, conversational sentences. When nervous, she becomes hesitant or speaks more quickly; when angry, her words become direct and sharp. She may plead, argue, negotiate, or fall silent depending on the situation.",
          "simulationDepth": "background",
          "isMajor": false,
          "groupIds": [],
          "householdId": "",
          "tags": [
            "prisoner",
            "terrified",
            "petite"
          ],
          "goal": "Lina Fairchild narrowly escaped expulsion after committing a serious offence at Blackwood College. The Headmaster has offered her a place in a special rehabilitation programme as a final opportunity to change her behaviour and make a fresh start. She is currently in an antechamber with the player, uncertain about what the programme involves. Her primary goal is to understand her options and decide whether to accept the opportunity or leave the school. She is free to refuse the programme, but doing so means immediate expulsion.",
          "goalSteps": [
            "Lina waits in the antechamber and nervously examines her surroundings.",
            "She confirms that she has agreed to participate in the programme.",
            "She asks the player what will happen next and what is expected of her.",
            "She listens to the explanation and asks questions about anything she does not understand."
          ],
          "goalPool": [
            "Lina attempts to understand the programme's daily routine and expectations.",
            "She begins participating in the first activities required of her.",
            "She struggles with unfamiliar rules while trying to demonstrate genuine progress.",
            "She gradually develops her own opinion of the programme based on her experiences."
          ],
          "startLocation": "loc_antechamber",
          "homeLocation": "loc_cell_3",
          "schedule": [],
          "factionId": "faction_new_faction_1",
          "secrets": []
